###
# ANTIC Notification Service - API Testing
# REST Client file for VS Code REST Client extension
# Base URL: https://notification.antic.cm
###

###
# WORKING! The API is now accessible at https://notification.antic.cm
###

@baseUrl = https://notification.antic.cm
@apiKey = ak_4b2eee5433ba901033f5a741ca48c452

### ============================================
### HEALTH CHECK
### ============================================

### Health Check - No auth required
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Content-Type: application/json


### ============================================
### WHATSAPP NOTIFICATIONS
### ============================================

### Send WhatsApp Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/whatsapp
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "recipient": "+237675080477",
  "message": "ANTIC vous dis Bonsoir"
}

### Send WhatsApp Message with Media (Image)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/whatsapp
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "recipient": "+237675080477",
  "message": "Check out this image!",
  "mediaUrl": "https://example.com/image.jpg"
}

### Send WhatsApp Message to Multiple Recipients
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/whatsapp
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "recipient": "+237123456789,+237987654321",
  "message": "Bulk message to multiple recipients"
}


### ============================================
### TELEGRAM NOTIFICATIONS
### ============================================

### Send Telegram Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/telegram
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "recipient": "+237691172662",
  "message": "ANTIC vous dis Bonsoir via Telegram!"
}

### Send Telegram Message with Username
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/telegram
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "recipient": "@username",
  "message": "Direct message to Telegram username"
}

### Send Telegram Message with Chat ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/telegram
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "recipient": "123456789",
  "message": "Message using Telegram chat ID"
}


### ============================================
### MATTERMOST NOTIFICATIONS (if configured)
### ============================================

### Send Mattermost Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/mattermost
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "recipient": "@username",
  "message": "Hello from ANTIC Notification Service via Mattermost!"
}


### ============================================
### MESSAGE STATUS & HISTORY
### ============================================

### Get All Messages
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/messages
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Messages with Filters (WhatsApp only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/messages?service=whatsapp
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Messages with Filters (Telegram only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/messages?service=telegram
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Messages with Status Filter (sent only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/messages?status=sent
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Messages with Status Filter (failed only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/messages?status=failed
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Messages with Combined Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/messages?service=whatsapp&status=sent&limit=10
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Specific Message by ID
# Replace {messageId} with actual message ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/messages/68f49e5e75cd6ebc9a9b8833
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}


### ============================================
### SERVICE STATUS
### ============================================

### Get Service Status (All services)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/status
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get WhatsApp Service Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/status/whatsapp
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Telegram Service Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/status/telegram
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}


### ============================================
### ADMIN ENDPOINTS (Requires JWT Token)
### ============================================

### Admin Login
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Extract token from login response
@authToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### Get Admin Status (requires admin token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get All API Keys (requires admin token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/api-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Create New API Key (requires admin token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/api-keys
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "New Test API Key",
  "permissions": ["whatsapp:send", "telegram:send"],
  "rateLimit": {
    "requests": 100,
    "windowMs": 3600000
  }
}

### Deactivate API Key (requires admin token)
# Replace {keyId} with actual API key ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/api-keys/68f49e5e75cd6ebc9a9b8833
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Connect WhatsApp (requires admin token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/whatsapp/connect
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Disconnect WhatsApp (requires admin token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/whatsapp/disconnect
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get WhatsApp QR Code (requires admin token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/whatsapp/qr
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Set Telegram Bot Token (requires admin token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/telegram/config
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "botToken": "1234567890:ABCdefGHIjklMNOpqrsTUVwxyz"
}

### Connect Telegram (requires admin token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/telegram/connect
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Disconnect Telegram (requires admin token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/telegram/disconnect
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### ============================================
### TESTING SCENARIOS
### ============================================

### Test 1: Send WhatsApp and check status
# @name whatsappTest
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/whatsapp
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "recipient": "+237123456789",
  "message": "Test message - scenario 1"
}

### Get the message ID from previous request
@messageId = {{whatsappTest.response.body.$.messageId}}

### Check message status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/messages/{{messageId}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}


### Test 2: Send to invalid number (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/whatsapp
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "recipient": "invalid-number",
  "message": "This should fail validation"
}


### Test 3: Send without API key (should return 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/whatsapp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipient": "+237123456789",
  "message": "This should fail - no API key"
}


### Test 4: Send with invalid API key (should return 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/whatsapp
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: invalid_api_key_123

{
  "recipient": "+237123456789",
  "message": "This should fail - invalid API key"
}


### Test 5: Rate limit test (send multiple requests quickly)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/whatsapp
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "recipient": "+237123456789",
  "message": "Rate limit test 1"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/whatsapp
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "recipient": "+237123456789",
  "message": "Rate limit test 2"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/whatsapp
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "recipient": "+237123456789",
  "message": "Rate limit test 3"
}


